 the Colonial Industrial Quarter.","source_url":"https://www.historicbethlehem.org/visit-us/experience/heritage-trail/","source_title":"Self-Guided Heritage Trail Tour","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Choose a route and duration appropriate to daylight, weather, and personal mobility; some associated sites or tours may charge admission.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
